===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dyew-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|journal}}, from {{der|en|xno|jurnal|t=daily}}, from {{der|en|fro|jornel|t=day}} (whence modern {{cog|fr|journal}}),<ref name="OEtylD">{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref> from {{der|en|la|diurnālis}}, from {{m|la|diurnus|t=of the day}}. {{doublet|en|diurnal}}  and the {{m|en|journal#Etymology 2|journal}} from French.

